  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Progressive hearing loss in both ears over about three years, worse on the left, with poor understanding of soft speech; type and cause not yet established at intake; audiology and otolaryngology evaluation requested</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
